  (text "How to read this schematic\nEach box is a page. Green lines are wires. A signal that goes to another page ends in a name tag:\ntags with the same name are connected, even on different pages. A small text on a wire names it.\nThe symbols marked +5V, +5V_YM, +4V5A, +3V3 and GND are power connections.\nParts marked DNP are not fitted by PCBWay. Pages: Power > Controller > Sound chip > Audio out > Front panel." (at 30.48 140 0)
